---
title: 07 - Meeting Processing Sequence Diagram
---
sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 actor User as Meeting reviewer
 participant UI as Browser UI
 participant API as FastAPI
 participant Store as JobStore
 participant Worker as JobWorker thread
 participant Pipe as run_pipeline
 User->>UI: Select audio file
 UI->>API: POST /api/jobs (multipart)
 API->>API: Validate suffix, nonempty and size <= 200 MiB
 API->>API: Persist audio file
 API->>Store: create(job_id, filename, source)
 Store-->>API: queued job
 API-->>UI: HTTP 202 {job_id}
 par Background processing
  Worker->>Store: Select oldest queued job
  Store-->>Worker: job
  Worker->>Store: status = running
  Worker->>Pipe: processor(source, config, artifacts, progress)
  loop Stage progress callbacks
   Pipe->>Worker: progress(stage, fraction)
   Worker->>Store: Update stage and progress
  end
  Pipe->>Pipe: Write transcript, RTTM, minutes and run artifacts
  Pipe-->>Worker: MeetingMinutes
  Worker->>Store: summary_revision, summary_error and complete
 and UI polling while selected
  loop Every 1500 ms, with pending-request guard
   UI->>API: GET /api/jobs/{id} and GET /api/jobs
   API->>Store: Read job metadata
   Store-->>API: Status, stage, progress and revision
   API-->>UI: JSON responses
  end
 end
 UI->>API: GET /api/jobs/{id}/result
 API->>Store: result(job_id)
 Store->>Store: Merge original minutes and SQL overlays
 Store-->>API: ResultView
 API-->>UI: original, edited, revision, summary_stale
 UI-->>User: Show transcript and available minutes
